      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>The “Prayer of the Jewish Soldier Before Going into Battle” was first published by Rabbi Dr. Nathan Lopes Cardozo at the website of the Cardozo Academy in 2009. The prayer was updated and shared by Rabbi Cardozo in 2012. The version that appears here was updated for the incursion in Gaza by the IDF during the summer of 2014.</tei:p>
